{title: Lazy Flies}
{artist: Beck}
{start_of_part: Intro}
[C][G][A][E][Fma7][C]
[C][G][A][E][Fma7][C]
{end_of_part}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]la[G]zy [A]flies [E]all h[F]overing a[C]bove
the [C]ma[G]gist[A]rate, [E]he [F]puts on his [C]gloves
and he l[D7]ooks to the cl[G]ouds all [F]pink and dish[C]eveled
there m[B7]ust be some blu[C]eprints, some [G]creed of the [F#]devil
insc[F]ribed in our m[C]inds
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus 1}
a [Am]hideous g[D]ame [F]vanishes in [Am]thin air
the [Am]vanity of s[D]laves [F]who wants to [Am]be there?
to s[E]weep the deb[F]ris to harness dead-[C]horses
to [D]ride in the [G]sun a [F]life of con[C]fessions
[E]written in the [F]dust[G#]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]out in[G] the m[A]angrov[E]es the [F]mynah birds c[C]ry
in the [C]shadows [G]of [A]sulphur [E]the t[F]rawlers drift [C]by
they're [D7]chewing dried [G]meat in a [F]house of disr[C]epute
[B7]the dust of [C]opiates and [G]syphilis [F#]patients
on [F]brochure vac[C]ations
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus2}
[Am]fear has a [D]glare that [F]traps you like [Am]searchlights
the [Am]puritans s[D]tare their [F]souls are fluo[Am]resecent
the [E]skin of a [F]robot vibrates with [C]pleasure
[D]matrons and [G]gigolos ca[F]rouse in the [C]parlor
their [E]hand-grenade [F]eyes invalid and [G#]blind
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_part: Interlude}
(Play verse chords)
{end_of_part}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus 3}
a [Am]hideous g[D]ame [F]vanishes in [Am]thin air
the [Am]vanity of s[D]laves [F]who wants to [Am]be there?
to s[E]weep the deb[F]ris to harness dead-h[C]orses
to [D]ride in the [G]sun a [F]life of con[C]fessions
[E]written in the d[F]ust[G#]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_part: Outro}
(La la la over verse chords)
{end_of_part}
